d straight clears nearly half my hand (I have 18 cards), drastically increasing win probability. It cannot be beaten by any non-bomb or non-rocket, and peasants may lack bombs. Even if one does, I retain strong mid-to-high cards (A, K, J, Q still partially present, plus Red Joker) to continue aggressively.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♦3", "♥4", "♣5", "♠6", "♦7", "♠8", "♠9", "♣10", "♥J", "♥Q"]}'}
